[0.0, "o", "Investigating REAL data for tenant \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: which open deals have had no activity in the last 30 days, and what are they worth?\r\n\u001b[2m2026-09-23 12:58:22\u001b[0m [\u001b[33m\u001b[1mwarning  \u001b[0m] \u001b[1mmcp.nothing_admissible        \u001b[0m \u001b[36mlabel\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mposthog\u001b[0m \u001b[36mreason\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m'the server was queried and offered no tool Cortex can admit; every tool must declare readOnlyHint: true'\u001b[0m\r\nRead-only: no write capability exists in the tool registry.\r\nCapabilities available to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: github, hubspot, posthog, slack\r\n  [  0.1s]          checking what data exists\r\n  [  1.1s]          found github__list_repositories\r\n  [  1.1s]          found posthog__list_events\r\n  [  1.1s]          found posthog__list_projects\r\n  [  1.1s]          checking memory for prior context\r\n  [  6.3s] step 1   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 11.1s] step 1   calling hubspot__pipeline\r\n  [ 12.8s] step 1   got hubspot__pipeline (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 12.8s] step 2   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 16.3s] step 2   got read hubspot.pipeline in full (73 rows) (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 16.3s] step 3   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 24.2s] step 3   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 25.7s] step 3   got hubspot__search (5 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 25.7s] step 4   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 29.2s] step 4   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 29.2s] step 4   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 40.9s] step 4   got hubspot__search (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 40.9s] step 4   got hubspot__search (7 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 40.9s] step 5   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 48.4s] step 5   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 48.4s] step 5   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 50.0s] step 5   got hubspot__search (8 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 50.0s] step 5   got hubspot__search (9 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 50.0s] step 6   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 58.4s] step 6   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 58.4s] step 6   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 60.8s] step 6   got hubspot__search (10 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 60.8s] step 6   got hubspot__search (11 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 60.8s] step 7   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 68.9s] step 7   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 68.9s] step 7   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 70.4s] step 7   got hubspot__search (12 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 70.4s] step 7   got hubspot__search (13 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 70.4s] step 8   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 90.6s]          drafting the report from 13 observation(s)\r\n  [107.3s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [107.3s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause (0.0s)\r\n  [114.0s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Which open deals have had no activity in the last 30 days (i.e., before 2026-08-24, given today is 2026-09-23), and what are they worth?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: high\r\nTook 107s over 8 steps, 50,305 tokens, 13 observations gathered, 6 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  No open deals have gone without activity in the last \u2588\u2588 days: all \u2588\u2588 currently open deals, worth a combined $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588, show a last-modified date on or after 2026-08-24.  [hubspot.search 3aa13ba1, hubspot.pipeline 43450ab8]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  No stale open deals exist in the \u2588\u2588-day window  (high)\r\n    - A search for open deals last modified before 2026-08-24 (more than \u2588\u2588 days before today, 2026-09-23) returned zero results.  [hubspot.search b9a2690b]\r\n    - A search for open deals last modified on or after 2026-08-24 returned all \u2588\u2588 open deals, worth a combined $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2014 the same \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 and total as the full open pipeline.  [hubspot.search 3aa13ba1, hubspot.pipeline 43450ab8]\r\n    - \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 these two queries show every open deal has had activity within the last \u2588\u2588 days, so none qualify as stale under that definition.  [hubspot.search b9a2690b, hubspot.search 3aa13ba1]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Two of the retrieved observations (the full \u2588\u2588-row open-deal list and the \u2588\u2588-row 'modified since 2026-08-24' list) were seen only as digests, not read row-by-row, so individual deal-level modification timestamps were not manually verified beyond the aggregate \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588s.\r\n  - HubSpot's hs_lastmodifieddate reflects any field change (including automated system updates), not necessarily meaningful sales activity such as a call, email, or stage change \u2014 so 'no activity' in a stricter sense (human engagement) could not be distinguished from this data.\r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Attempts to filter on hs_is_closed_won/hs_is_closed_lost combined with date filters, and hs_is_closed with a second LT date filter at 2026-09-01, both returned zero rows even though matching deals should \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588ally exist \u2014 suggesting the HubSpot search tool may not correctly combine certain filter combinations rather than reflecting a true absence of data.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  43450ab8  hubspot.pipeline  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?open=true\r\n  b9a2690b  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n  f2852add  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n  ae407e99  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed_lost=false&hs_is_closed_won=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n  95959ed0  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-09-01\r\n  3aa13ba1  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[GTE]=2026-08-24\r\n\r\nphase breakdown (114s wall, 112s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1      1.0    1%     1.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  recall           1      5.2    5%     5.2  in 0 out 0\r\n  loop_model       8     63.9   56%     8.0  in 16 out 4,910 cached 213,040\r\n  loop_tools       7     20.4   18%     2.9  in 0 out 0\r\n  draft            1     16.7   15%    16.7  in 43,822 out 1,557\r\n  gate             1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  verify           1      4.5    4%     4.5  in 18,329 out 320\r\n  sufficiency      1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  unmeasured              2.2    2%\r\n  cache hit rate: 77%\r\n"]
